# yarn.lock is deliberately NOT ignored. The image installs this extension with
# `jlpm install --immutable`, so the committed lockfile decides which bytes end
# up in the labextension bundle; ignoring it is what made every build re-resolve
# the whole dependency tree from the registry. Regenerate after changing
# package.json with `uvx --from 'jupyterlab>=4.2' jlpm install --mode
# update-lockfile` (README, "JupyterLab extension lockfile").
